MAIN CONTROLS

Mouse Left Button: Select, Increase

Mouse Right Button: Decrease

Keyboard Arrow Keys / Controller DPad, Analog Stick: 
  Step, Increase/Decrease

Keyboard W, D, Enter Key / Controller A, X, R1 Button: 
  Ok, Increase

Keyboard S, A, Backspace Key / Controller B, Y, L1 Button: 
  Cancel, Decrease

Keyboard Escape, Space Key / Controller Start, Back Button: 
  Settings, Back
